  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Alright, longest consecutive sequence is done.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 3460,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 104,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Three approaches.",
      "start_ms": 3820,
      "end_ms": 4660,
      "start_frame": 115,
      "end_frame": 140,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Brute force, start from every number and repeatedly search the list.",
      "start_ms": 5320,
      "end_ms": 9620,
      "start_frame": 160,
      "end_frame": 289,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Worst case, O of n cubed.",
      "start_ms": 10340,
      "end_ms": 12580,
      "start_frame": 310,
      "end_frame": 377,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Better, sort once and scan neighbors.",
      "start_ms": 13240,
      "end_ms": 15780,
      "start_frame": 397,
      "end_frame": 473,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "O of n log n.",
      "start_ms": 16460,
      "end_ms": 18080,
      "start_frame": 494,
      "end_frame": 542,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Optimal, use a hash set.",
      "start_ms": 18560,
      "end_ms": 20220,
      "start_frame": 557,
      "end_frame": 607,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "And remember the one rule that matters most.",
      "start_ms": 21180,
      "end_ms": 23380,
      "start_frame": 635,
      "end_frame": 701,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Does x minus 1 exist?",
      "start_ms": 23880,
      "end_ms": 25280,
      "start_frame": 716,
      "end_frame": 758,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "If yes, x is not a start.",
      "start_ms": 25820,
      "end_ms": 27600,
      "start_frame": 775,
      "end_frame": 828,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Skip it.",
      "start_ms": 28360,
      "end_ms": 29140,
      "start_frame": 851,
      "end_frame": 874,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "If no, start from x and walk forward.",
      "start_ms": 29140,
      "end_ms": 32600,
      "start_frame": 874,
      "end_frame": 978,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "That gives us expected O of n time with O of n extra space.",
      "start_ms": 33320,
      "end_ms": 37980,
      "start_frame": 1000,
      "end_frame": 1139,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "So when an unsorted array asks about consecutive values, think fast membership.",
      "start_ms": 38620,
      "end_ms": 44000,
      "start_frame": 1159,
      "end_frame": 1320,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Then find the real sequence start.",
      "start_ms": 44680,
      "end_ms": 46780,
      "start_frame": 1340,
      "end_frame": 1403,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Question number 10.",
      "start_ms": 47860,
      "end_ms": 49400,
      "start_frame": 1436,
      "end_frame": 1482,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Complete.",
      "start_ms": 49600,
      "end_ms": 50100,
      "start_frame": 1488,
      "end_frame": 1503,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Our roadmap is now 10 out of 227.",
      "start_ms": 51160,
      "end_ms": 55300,
      "start_frame": 1535,
      "end_frame": 1659,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "We stay inside arrays and hashing and continue to question number 11.",
      "start_ms": 55300,
      "end_ms": 61080,
      "start_frame": 1659,
      "end_frame": 1832,
      "word_count": 12
    }
